## Known Gotchas

[Service-specific quirks. Examples:]
- **Force unwrap** (`!`, `try!`) on network or decoding results crashes the app. See `swift-patterns.md §Errors and Optionals`.
- **Main-thread work**: blocking I/O on the main actor freezes the UI.
- **Optimistic UI**: roll back local state when the request fails (P4).
